---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="About Me | Morad Abaz" 
  description="About Morad Abaz - Data Engineer working with Spark, Iceberg, dbt on AWS. Maintaining SaaS Lakehouse platforms, diagnosing Spark pipelines, and writing technical posts on Medium."
>
  <div class="container page-container">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-main">
        <div class="badge badge-purple" style="margin-bottom: 0.8rem;">About Me</div>
        <h1>About <span class="gradient-text">Morad Abaz</span></h1>
        
        <div class="glass-card about-card prose">
          <p>
            I'm a Data Engineer working with Spark, Iceberg, and dbt on AWS. Right now I'm the sole DE at a SaaS company, maintaining a Lakehouse platform with Dozens of Glue jobs — which means when something breaks at 8am, it's on me to figure out why.
          </p>

          <p>
            Most of my day-to-day is diagnosing performance issues in Spark pipelines, understanding how Iceberg behaves under real production conditions, and making architectural decisions that I'll have to live with tomorrow. I write about these problems on <a href="https://medium.com/@moradabaz" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Medium</a>.
          </p>

          <p>
            Before data engineering I was a software developer (Python, PHP and React Native), which helps when the problem isn't the data but the code around it.
          </p>

          <div class="social-links-box">
            <h4>Connect with me</h4>
            <div class="social-buttons">
              <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/morad-abbou-azaz/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-primary">
                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
                  <path d="M19 3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14m-.5 15.5v-5.3a3.26 3.26 0 0 0-3.26-3.26c-.85 0-1.84.52-2.28 1.3v-1.11h-2.79v8.37h2.79v-4.93c0-.77.62-1.4 1.39-1.4a1.4 1.4 0 0 1 1.4 1.4v4.93h2.75M6.46 10.9v8.37H9.25V10.9H6.46M7.86 6.72a1.4 1.4 0 1 0 1.4 1.4 1.4 1.4 0 0 0-1.4-1.4z"/>
                </svg>
                LinkedIn Profile
              </a>
              <a href="https://medium.com/@moradabaz" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-secondary">
                Medium (@moradabaz)
              </a>
              <a href="https://github.com/moradisten" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-secondary">
                GitHub (@moradisten)
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-container {
    padding-top: 3.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 5rem;
  }

  .about-grid {
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  h1 {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .about-card {
    padding: 2.5rem;
  }

  .prose p {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 1.35rem;
  }

  .social-links-box {
    margin-top: 2.2rem;
    padding-top: 1.8rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  }

  .social-links-box h4 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-main);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .social-buttons {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.8rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about-card {
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
